A collaboration event between '''The Great Cat War''' and the YouTuber known as '''[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgL6J6oL8F69vm-GcPScmwg Chocolate]''' (巧克力, ''Qiǎokèlì'', '''Chocolate''') was originally held from July 21st, 2017 to August 4th, 2017. The collaboration includes exclusive stages going on during collaboration period.

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Taiwanese Version Limited Collaboration Stages & Awaken Stages have arrived!'''}}<br>
Choose Legend Stages (Event Stages) in The Battle Cats title screen, then click "Battle!", then you can see {{Color|#FF0000|'''Cat Slave King'''}} event stage!<br>
Clear the stage for a chance to obtain {{Color|#FF0000|'''Cat Slave Chocolate'''}}!~<br>
<small><small>※Only applies to those who do not own {{Color|#FF0000|'''Cat Slave Chocolate'''}}</small></small>

Furthermore, the event opened {{Color|#FF0000|'''Chocolate Awakens'''}} stage, clear the stage for a chance to obtain {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Cat Slave Chocolate True Form'''}}<br>
<small><small>※Requires Cat Slave Chocolate level at least 20 to evolve<br>
※If Cat Slave Chocolate is not yet obtained when the stage is cleared, it is automatically obtained once the stage is cleared.</small></small>

